# nothing, and it MUST stay tracked — US-517's `deno cache --frozen` gate exists
# to fail the build when a resolved dependency drifts, and a frozen check with no
# committed lockfile has nothing to freeze against. Removed rather than acted on:
# the ignore was the bug, not the tracking.

