# US-2685 sweep 2026-08-19: `assets/*` was added while every file under it was
# already TRACKED, so the ignore did nothing (gitignore only applies to
# untracked paths) and all 67 read as modified in every working tree. The
# marketing media is now untracked; these are NOT, because they are product
# artifacts rather than raw footage and src/lib/__tests__/measure-card.test.ts
# READS geometry-v1.json - untracking it passes locally and fails on a fresh
# CI clone, which is the worst shape a fix can have.
!assets/measure-card/
